# Spotify Developer Dashboard > App > Settings > Redirect URIs
# Add exactly: http://127.0.0.1:5199/auth/callback
# VITE_ öneki taşıyan her değişken tarayıcı paketine gömülür.
# Spotify client secret GEREKMEZ ve ASLA buraya eklenmemelidir (PKCE kullanıyoruz).
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:5199/auth/callback

# Optional: alternative audio-features provider (ReccoBeats)
VITE_RECCOBEATS_BASE_URL=https://api.reccobeats.com/v1

# Optional: Apple iTunes storefront used for 30s previews (default TR).
# Apple's catalogue differs per country; the ISO-3166 alpha-2 code matters for
# regional-only releases.
VITE_ITUNES_COUNTRY=TR
